# Sprint 1 Planning

**Project:** CareerConnect  
**Repository:** https://github.com/Sukhesood/CareerConnect  
**Sprint 1 Deadline:** September 28, 2026  

## Sprint Goal

The goal of Sprint 1 is to organize the CareerConnect project, complete the required planning and documentation, and begin development of the first basic features.

By the end of the sprint, the team plans to demonstrate user registration and login, along with resume upload.

